INSERT INTO public.ap2_kn VALUES ('kn-ins');
WARNING:  overlay_branch: table "public.ap2_kn" has no PRIMARY KEY; using experimental ctid-based row identity (overlay_branch.keyless_tables=on)
DETAIL:  Row identity is the physical tuple location (ctid, xmin).  Concurrent UPDATE/DELETE on this table by other sessions may change a row's ctid and cause the branch to silently miss that row's delta (detected only at apply time as a conflict error).
HINT:  Add a PRIMARY KEY (or ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN ... GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY) to get durable row identity.
